        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks for calling Summit Air, this is the virtual assistant. How can I help?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "hi um our boiler quit overnight and the radiators are cold",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sorry to hear that, a cold boiler is no fun. Is it cold throughout the place, or just certain rooms?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "uh it's kind of everywhere i think it's like sixty one degrees in here right now so yeah pretty much the whole house",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it, sixty-one degrees and dropping. Who's at home with it right now?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "um my husband's here and my mother in law she moved in with us after her stroke last spring so she's home most of the day sitting by the radiator that's why i'm kind of worried about it getting cold",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks for telling me. Is she doing okay at the moment?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yeah she's okay for now i think she's just bundled up on the couch but she gets cold easily and it's been a long night so the sooner someone can come out the better",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Understood, we'll get someone out as soon as we can. Let me check your address first. What's the street address, and the ZIP code?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "it's one oh eight 20 71st avenue in forest hills the zip is one one three seven five",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "We do cover that area. Do you know roughly what kind of system you have, a boiler with radiators?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yeah it's a boiler with radiators like the old style cast iron ones i don't know the brand or anything like that sorry my husband would know more but he's out right now",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "No problem at all. Is this your place, or are you renting?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "um we own it my husband and i bought it a few years back",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it. Anything the technician should know when they get there, like a gate code, a buzzer or a pet?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "no gate code just the front door buzzer um there's no pet my husband's cell is probably the best way to reach him if they need anything oh and if you can please have them come up the front steps carefully it's icy out there this morning",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I have your home at 108-20 71st Avenue, one one three seven five, and the best number is two one two, five five five, zero nine nine nine, is that right?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yeah that's the number i'm calling from so that should work um actually i'm not sure that's his cell i'd have to double check with him but the address is right",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it, the address is right and we'll use the number you're calling from. I'll note your husband's cell for the team once you have it. Let me check when we can come out. Thanks, I've got the address. Since your place is below 65 degrees and someone at home is vulnerable, this is our top priority. Today we have openings between 12 and 4 this afternoon, or 4 to 8 this evening. Which works better?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "the first one the twelve to four window please",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Perfect, booking that now. Can I get a name for the booking?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "marisol vega",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks, Marisol. Booking that now. You're all set for today, Monday, November 2, with the technician arriving between 12 and 4. Anything else?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "no that's everything thanks so much bye",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks for calling Summit Air. Have a great rest of your day.",
          "said": null
        }
