      "grader_notes": "The agent re-asked about the system type after the caller had already said 'boiler,' stacked two questions in its opening turns, and probed the mother-in-law's health ('Is she doing okay at the moment?') after the stroke was mentioned. It also never said 'I've marked this call top priority' even though the system marked the call Urgent, and it repeated 'Booking that now.'",
