      "transcript": [
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks for calling Summit Air, this is the virtual assistant. How can I help?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "hi um our boiler quit overnight and the radiators are cold",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sorry to hear that, a boiler going out overnight is rough. Is it cold inside right now, do you know roughly what temperature it is?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yeah it's uh about 61 in here it was fine when we went to bed so i'm not sure what happened",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it, 61 inside. What's the address where the boiler is?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "it's one oh eight 20 71st ave forest hills one one three seven five",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks. Do you know roughly what kind of system it is, a boiler with radiators, and about how old?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yeah it's a boiler with radiators the old kind i don't really know how old it is maybe it was here when we bought the place sorry i'm not great with that stuff",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "No problem at all. Are you the owner, or are you renting?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "we own the place my husband and i bought it a few years ago um i think that's what you need right",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Yes, that's what I need. Who's home with it right now?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "just my husband and my mother in law she moved in with us last spring after her stroke so she's home most of the day sitting by the radiator that's why i'm kind of worried about it getting so cold",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks for telling me. Is she doing okay at the moment?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "um she's doing okay i think she's still getting used to things and it's like slow some days but she's pretty comfortable the cold is what's bugging me though can someone come out today",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I'll check today's availability for you now. Today I have 12 to 4, 4 to 8, or 8 to 8. Which one works best for you?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "um the first one 12 to 4 that works thanks",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I have your home at 108-20 71st Ave, Forest Hills, one one three seven five, and the best number is two one two, five five five, zero nine nine nine, is that right?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yeah that's right but um i'm actually calling from my cell so you can use that one wait sorry the number i'm calling from is the one you have so that's fine too",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it, the number you're calling from is fine. Anything the technician should know when they get there, like a gate code, a buzzer, or a pet?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "um no gate code just ring the bell no pets oh and maybe tell them to knock loud because my husband might be in the basement and uh my mother in law doesn't hear the doorbell that well so they might have to wait a minute",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I'll let the technician know to ring the bell and knock loudly. Booking that now. Can I get your name for the booking?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "marisol vega",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Perfect, booking that now. You're all set for today, Monday, November 2, with the technician arriving between 12 and 4. Anything else?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "no that's it thanks so much bye",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks for calling Summit Air. Have a great rest of your day.",
          "said": null
        }
